      "Part 2 (Internal Financial Controls over Financial Reporting (IFCoFR) under Section 143(3)(i)): Under the ICAI Guidance Note on IFCoFR and Section 143(3)(i), the existence of even one unmitigated Material Weakness at the balance sheet date legally precludes an unqualified opinion, requiring a modified (qualified or adverse) IFCoFR audit report.",
