      "Part 3 (Substantive Revenue Cut-Off Testing & E-Invoicing Real-Time Triangulation: SA 240): IRP timestamps and E-Way Bill RFID toll logs provide independent, immutable digital proof of actual dispatch dates, preventing management from backdating ERP revenue invoices to manipulate fiscal cut-offs.",
