      "Part 2 (Inventory Aging Analytics, Slow-Moving Reserves & Scrap Revenue Forensics: SA 501): The mass-balance equation (Input Weight = Output Product Weight + Scrap Weight) establishes an objective physical expectation of scrap generation; significant shortfalls between theoretical scrap and recorded sales reveal off-book cash embezzlement.",
