      "Part 2 (Capital Work-in-Progress (CWIP) Aging Analytics & Project Suspension Forensics: CARO Clause i(a)): Ind AS 36 requires that when an asset suffers permanent cessation or regulatory revocation with zero future economic benefits, its recoverable amount is zero, requiring an immediate 100% impairment loss in profit or loss.",
