          "What comes next? The following block moves from gathering evidence to communicating the result. You will study key audit matters under SA 701, and the structure of the independent auditor's report itself. If the first half of the course was about forming a conclusion, the second half is about stating it clearly. Keep your notes on today's standards close, because the report is where they all surface."
