        "example": "Aegis Industrial Conglomerate's preliminary financial statements report $480M in profit before tax and an interest coverage ratio of 2.526x against a mandatory covenant of 2.50x. The audit team must establish materiality, interrogate 1.2 million general ledger journal entries, evaluate $120M in subjective warranty reserves, and determine whether identified misstatements force a covenant breach or require an audit opinion qualification.",
        "code": "def initialize_milestone7_capstone_profile(\n    consolidated_revenue_usd: float = 9800000000.0,\n    total_assets_usd: float = 14200000000.0,\n    normalized_pbt_usd: float = 480000000.0,\n    total_debt_usd: float = 380000000.0,\n    ebitda_usd: float = 960000000.0,\n    annual_interest_expense_usd: float = 380000000.0,\n    covenant_min_interest_coverage: float = 2.50,\n    reported_eps_usd: float = 2.46,\n    wall_street_consensus_eps_usd: float = 2.45\n) -> dict:\n    # Capstone Engagement Financial Profile & Threat Modeling Engine\n    actual_coverage_ratio = ebitda_usd / annual_interest_expense_usd\n    covenant_margin = actual_coverage_ratio - covenant_min_interest_coverage\n    eps_headroom = reported_eps_usd - wall_street_consensus_eps_usd\n    \n    covenant_threat = covenant_margin < 0.05\n    eps_pressure_threat = eps_headroom <= 0.02\n    \n    return {\n        'consolidated_revenue': consolidated_revenue_usd,\n        'total_assets': total_assets_usd,\n        'normalized_pbt': normalized_pbt_usd,\n        'actual_interest_coverage': round(actual_coverage_ratio, 3),\n        'covenant_threshold': covenant_min_interest_coverage,\n        'covenant_headroom_ratio': round(covenant_margin, 3),\n        'covenant_threat_active': covenant_threat,\n        'reported_eps': reported_eps_usd,\n        'consensus_eps': wall_street_consensus_eps_usd,\n        'eps_margin_usd': round(eps_headroom, 2),\n        'bonus_cliff_pressure_active': eps_pressure_threat,\n        'overall_engagement_risk': \"MAXIMUM_HEIGHTENED_SKEPTICISM_REQUIRED\"\n    }\n\nprofile = initialize_milestone7_capstone_profile()\nprint(\"=== Milestone 7 Capstone: Statutory Audit War Room Briefing ===\")\nprint(f\"Consolidated Revenue:           ${profile['consolidated_revenue']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Total Assets:                   ${profile['total_assets']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Normalized Pre-Tax Profit:      ${profile['normalized_pbt']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Interest Coverage Ratio:        {profile['actual_interest_coverage']}x (Covenant: {profile['covenant_threshold']}x)\")\nprint(f\"Covenant Headroom Margin:       {profile['covenant_headroom_ratio']}x (Critical: {profile['covenant_threat_active']})\")\nprint(f\"Reported EPS vs Consensus:      ${profile['reported_eps']} vs ${profile['consensus_eps']} (Margin: ${profile['eps_margin_usd']})\")\nprint(f\"Bonus Cliff Pressure Active:    {profile['bonus_cliff_pressure_active']}\")\nprint(f\"Assurance Posture Mandate:      {profile['overall_engagement_risk']}\")",
        "output": "=== Milestone 7 Capstone: Statutory Audit War Room Briefing ===\nConsolidated Revenue:           $9,800,000,000.00\nTotal Assets:                   $14,200,000,000.00\nNormalized Pre-Tax Profit:      $480,000,000.00\nInterest Coverage Ratio:        2.526x (Covenant: 2.5x)\nCovenant Headroom Margin:       0.026x (Critical: True)\nReported EPS vs Consensus:      $2.46 vs $2.45 (Margin: $0.01)\nBonus Cliff Pressure Active:    True\nAssurance Posture Mandate:      MAXIMUM_HEIGHTENED_SKEPTICISM_REQUIRED",
        "tryIt": "Modify reported_eps_usd to $2.55 to observe the EPS margin widen to $0.1 and Bonus Cliff Pressure Active turn False; the covenant threat (0.026x headroom) stays True.",
