        "example": "Aegis's IT audit revealed 5 developers had unrestricted SAP root access without change logging. The partner declared a material GITC weakness, assessed Control Risk at maximum (0.90), and classified Long-Term Aviation Contracts (IR=0.92) as a Significant Risk. Solving the Audit Risk Model (AR=5% / [0.92 * 0.90]) forced allowable Detection Risk down to 6.04%, mandating exhaustive substantive sampling.",
        "code": "def evaluate_isa315_war_room_risk_matrix(\n    target_audit_risk_pct: float = 5.0,\n    gitc_pass: bool = False,\n    accounts_data: list = None\n) -> dict:\n    # ISA 315 (Revised 2019) Enterprise Risk Decomposition Engine\n    if accounts_data is None:\n        accounts_data = [\n            {\"name\": \"Long-Term Aviation Contracts\", \"balance\": 3200000000.0, \"complex\": 0.95, \"subj\": 0.90, \"bias\": 0.90},\n            {\"name\": \"Goodwill & Intangibles\", \"balance\": 2100000000.0, \"complex\": 0.85, \"subj\": 0.92, \"bias\": 0.85},\n            {\"name\": \"Commercial Warranty Liabilities\", \"balance\": 340000000.0, \"complex\": 0.80, \"subj\": 0.85, \"bias\": 0.80},\n            {\"name\": \"Trade Accounts Receivable\", \"balance\": 1400000000.0, \"complex\": 0.50, \"subj\": 0.60, \"bias\": 0.55},\n            {\"name\": \"Property, Plant & Equipment\", \"balance\": 5600000000.0, \"complex\": 0.30, \"subj\": 0.25, \"bias\": 0.35},\n            {\"name\": \"Cash & Cash Equivalents\", \"balance\": 1200000000.0, \"complex\": 0.15, \"subj\": 0.10, \"bias\": 0.20}\n        ]\n        \n    ar_decimal = target_audit_risk_pct / 100.0\n    # If GITC fails, base control risk is escalated to maximum 0.90\n    control_risk = 0.90 if not gitc_pass else 0.40\n    \n    assessed_accounts = []\n    significant_risk_count = 0\n    \n    for acc in accounts_data:\n        # Inherent Risk Spectrum = 0.40*complex + 0.35*subj + 0.25*bias\n        ir_score = (acc['complex'] * 0.40) + (acc['subj'] * 0.35) + (acc['bias'] * 0.25)\n        is_sig = ir_score >= 0.75\n        if is_sig: significant_risk_count += 1\n        \n        romm = ir_score * control_risk\n        allowable_dr = min(1.0, ar_decimal / romm) if romm > 0 else 1.0\n        \n        procedure = (\n            \"MANDATORY_SPECIALIST_AND_EXTENSIVE_SUBSTANTIVE_TOD\"\n            if is_sig else\n            \"STANDARD_TESTS_OF_DETAILS_AND_ANALYTICS\"\n        )\n        \n        assessed_accounts.append({\n            'account': acc['name'],\n            'balance_usd': acc['balance'],\n            'ir_spectrum': round(ir_score, 3),\n            'is_significant_risk': is_sig,\n            'romm_score': round(romm, 3),\n            'allowable_dr_pct': round(allowable_dr * 100.0, 2),\n            'mandated_audit_strategy': procedure\n        })\n        \n    return {\n        'target_audit_risk': target_audit_risk_pct,\n        'gitc_operational_status': \"DEFICIENT_MAXIMUM_CONTROL_RISK\" if not gitc_pass else \"EFFECTIVE\",\n        'total_significant_risks': significant_risk_count,\n        'account_risk_breakdown': assessed_accounts\n    }\n\nwar_risk = evaluate_isa315_war_room_risk_matrix()\nprint(\"=== ISA 315 / AS 2110 War Room Risk Assessment Matrix ===\")\nprint(f\"Target Audit Risk:          {war_risk['target_audit_risk']}%\")\nprint(f\"GITC Audit Finding:         {war_risk['gitc_operational_status']}\")\nprint(f\"Significant Risks Flagged:  {war_risk['total_significant_risks']} Accounts\")\nprint(\"\\nAccount Risk Spectrum & Allowable Detection Risk Breakdown:\")\nfor a in war_risk['account_risk_breakdown']:\n    print(f\" - {a['account']:32}: IR={a['ir_spectrum']:.3f} | RoMM={a['romm_score']:.3f} | \"\n          f\"Allowable DR={a['allowable_dr_pct']:5.2f}% | SigRisk={str(a['is_significant_risk']):5} | Action: {a['mandated_audit_strategy']}\")",
        "output": "=== ISA 315 / AS 2110 War Room Risk Assessment Matrix ===\nTarget Audit Risk:          5.0%\nGITC Audit Finding:         DEFICIENT_MAXIMUM_CONTROL_RISK\nSignificant Risks Flagged:  3 Accounts\n\nAccount Risk Spectrum & Allowable Detection Risk Breakdown:\n - Long-Term Aviation Contracts    : IR=0.920 | RoMM=0.828 | Allowable DR= 6.04% | SigRisk=True  | Action: MANDATORY_SPECIALIST_AND_EXTENSIVE_SUBSTANTIVE_TOD\n - Goodwill & Intangibles          : IR=0.875 | RoMM=0.787 | Allowable DR= 6.35% | SigRisk=True  | Action: MANDATORY_SPECIALIST_AND_EXTENSIVE_SUBSTANTIVE_TOD\n - Commercial Warranty Liabilities : IR=0.818 | RoMM=0.736 | Allowable DR= 6.80% | SigRisk=True  | Action: MANDATORY_SPECIALIST_AND_EXTENSIVE_SUBSTANTIVE_TOD\n - Trade Accounts Receivable       : IR=0.548 | RoMM=0.493 | Allowable DR=10.15% | SigRisk=False | Action: STANDARD_TESTS_OF_DETAILS_AND_ANALYTICS\n - Property, Plant & Equipment     : IR=0.295 | RoMM=0.266 | Allowable DR=18.83% | SigRisk=False | Action: STANDARD_TESTS_OF_DETAILS_AND_ANALYTICS\n - Cash & Cash Equivalents         : IR=0.145 | RoMM=0.131 | Allowable DR=38.31% | SigRisk=False | Action: STANDARD_TESTS_OF_DETAILS_AND_ANALYTICS",
        "tryIt": "Set gitc_pass to True to observe how certified IT controls expand allowable detection risk across all operating accounts.",
