      "Part 2 (The Top-Down, Risk-Based Audit Approach & Entity-Level Controls (ELCs)): Direct ELCs operate with sufficient precision to detect misstatements and reduce process testing; indirect ELCs set cultural tone but lack precision to catch errors.",
