        "example": "An audit team deployed this Master Simulator on a $2.4B enterprise audit. The engine analyzed 50 multi-element contracts, discovered $3.2M in improperly recognized upfront revenue, caught $4.5M in FOB Destination cut-off misstatements, corrected a $15M gross-up error on marketplace sales, and identified a $2.8M CECL reserve shortfall. The resulting $10.5M net proposed adjustment preserved financial statement accuracy and prevented an SEC restatement.",
        "code": "def run_master_revenue_audit_simulator(\n    client_name: str = \"Vanguard Enterprise Software & Hardware Corp.\",\n    total_revenue_reported: float = 2400000000.0,\n    gross_ar_reported: float = 340000000.0,\n    planning_materiality: float = 12000000.0,\n    performance_materiality: float = 8400000.0,\n    contract_allocation_error: float = 3200000.0,\n    cutoff_misstatement_amount: float = 4500000.0,\n    gross_up_reclassification_amount: float = 15000000.0,\n    cecl_reserve_shortfall: float = 2800000.0\n) -> dict:\n    # Master Substantive Revenue & Receivables Audit Simulator\n    # 1. Aggregate Factual & Projected Misstatements\n    # Note: Gross-up reclassification affects revenue and COGS equally (zero net income impact, but revenue presentation misstatement)\n    paje_schedule = [\n        {\"area\": \"ASC 606 Contract Allocation\", \"type\": \"PREMATURE_REVENUE_ACCELERATION\", \"amount\": contract_allocation_error, \"impact\": \"OVERSTATEMENT_OF_REVENUE\"},\n        {\"area\": \"FOB Destination Cut-Off\", \"type\": \"PRE-DELIVERY_REVENUE_RECORDING\", \"amount\": cutoff_misstatement_amount, \"impact\": \"OVERSTATEMENT_OF_REVENUE\"},\n        {\"area\": \"Principal vs Agent (Gross/Net)\", \"type\": \"REVENUE_PRESENTATION_GROSS_UP\", \"amount\": gross_up_reclassification_amount, \"impact\": \"RECLASSIFICATION_REVENUE_COGS\"},\n        {\"area\": \"CECL Credit Loss Reserve\", \"type\": \"ALLOWANCE_VALUATION_SHORTFALL\", \"amount\": cecl_reserve_shortfall, \"impact\": \"UNDERSTATEMENT_OF_EXPENSES\"}\n    ]\n    \n    net_income_misstatement_total = contract_allocation_error + cutoff_misstatement_amount + cecl_reserve_shortfall\n    exceeds_performance_materiality = net_income_misstatement_total >= performance_materiality\n    exceeds_planning_materiality = net_income_misstatement_total >= planning_materiality\n    \n    if exceeds_planning_materiality:\n        audit_verdict = \"MATERIAL_MISSTATEMENT_OF_REVENUE_MANDATORY_ADJUSTMENT_REQUIRED\"\n        opinion_impact = \"QUALIFIED_OR_ADVERSE_OPINION_IF_NOT_ADJUSTED\"\n    elif exceeds_performance_materiality:\n        audit_verdict = \"SUBSTANTIAL_MISSTATEMENT_EXCEEDS_PERFORMANCE_MATERIALITY_ADJUSTMENT_STRONGLY_URGED\"\n        opinion_impact = \"UNQUALIFIED_PERMITTED_IF_PAJE_POSTED\"\n    else:\n        audit_verdict = \"MISSTATEMENTS_WITHIN_ACCEPTABLE_MARGIN_POST_TO_SUD\"\n        opinion_impact = \"UNQUALIFIED_OPINION\"\n        \n    return {\n        'client': client_name,\n        'total_revenue': total_revenue_reported,\n        'total_ar': gross_ar_reported,\n        'planning_mat': planning_materiality,\n        'perf_mat': performance_materiality,\n        'net_income_misstatements_total': net_income_misstatement_total,\n        'gross_up_reclass_total': gross_up_reclassification_amount,\n        'exceeds_perf_materiality': exceeds_performance_materiality,\n        'exceeds_planning_materiality': exceeds_planning_materiality,\n        'substantive_audit_verdict': audit_verdict,\n        'financial_opinion_impact': opinion_impact,\n        'proposed_adjustments_schedule': paje_schedule\n    }\n\nsim_res = run_master_revenue_audit_simulator()\nprint(\"=== Master Substantive Revenue & Receivables Audit Simulator ===\")\nprint(f\"Enterprise Audited:             {sim_res['client']}\")\nprint(f\"Total Reported Revenue:         ${sim_res['total_revenue']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Gross Accounts Receivable:      ${sim_res['total_ar']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Planning Materiality:           ${sim_res['planning_mat']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Performance Materiality:        ${sim_res['perf_mat']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Net Income Misstatements:       ${sim_res['net_income_misstatements_total']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Presentation Gross-Up Reclass:  ${sim_res['gross_up_reclass_total']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Exceeds Performance Materiality:{sim_res['exceeds_perf_materiality']}\")\nprint(f\"Audit Verdict:                  {sim_res['substantive_audit_verdict']}\")\nprint(f\"Audit Opinion Consequence:      {sim_res['financial_opinion_impact']}\")\nprint(\"\\nProposed Audit Journal Entry (PAJE) Ledger:\")\nfor adj in sim_res['proposed_adjustments_schedule']:\n    print(f\" - [{adj['area']:30}]: ${adj['amount']:,.2f} -> {adj['impact']}\")",
        "output": "=== Master Substantive Revenue & Receivables Audit Simulator ===\nEnterprise Audited:             Vanguard Enterprise Software & Hardware Corp.\nTotal Reported Revenue:         $2,400,000,000.00\nGross Accounts Receivable:      $340,000,000.00\nPlanning Materiality:           $12,000,000.00\nPerformance Materiality:        $8,400,000.00\nNet Income Misstatements:       $10,500,000.00\nPresentation Gross-Up Reclass:  $15,000,000.00\nExceeds Performance Materiality:True\nAudit Verdict:                  SUBSTANTIAL_MISSTATEMENT_EXCEEDS_PERFORMANCE_MATERIALITY_ADJUSTMENT_STRONGLY_URGED\nAudit Opinion Consequence:      UNQUALIFIED_PERMITTED_IF_PAJE_POSTED\n\nProposed Audit Journal Entry (PAJE) Ledger:\n - [ASC 606 Contract Allocation   ]: $3,200,000.00 -> OVERSTATEMENT_OF_REVENUE\n - [FOB Destination Cut-Off       ]: $4,500,000.00 -> OVERSTATEMENT_OF_REVENUE\n - [Principal vs Agent (Gross/Net)]: $15,000,000.00 -> RECLASSIFICATION_REVENUE_COGS\n - [CECL Credit Loss Reserve      ]: $2,800,000.00 -> UNDERSTATEMENT_OF_EXPENSES",
