        "example": "An audit team completed fieldwork and dated its report February 15. On February 26, prior to 10-K filing, the company settled a major patent dispute for $45M. Rather than re-auditing the entire company to February 28, the partner dual-dated the report: 'February 15, 2026, except as to Note 22, which is as of February 28, 2026.' This limited the extended audit duty exclusively to the litigation settlement.",
        "code": "def evaluate_dual_dating_decision(\n    original_fieldwork_completion_date: str = \"2026-02-20\",\n    financial_statement_issuance_date: str = \"2026-03-05\",\n    subsequent_event_date: str = \"2026-02-28\",\n    event_description: str = \"Fab facility explosion causing $80M damage\",\n    footnote_reference: str = \"Note 18 - Facility Casualty Loss\",\n    chosen_strategy: str = \"DUAL_DATE\"\n) -> dict:\n    # Dual-Dating vs. Full Report Re-Dating Decision Engine (PCAOB AS 3110 / ISA 560)\n    if chosen_strategy == \"DUAL_DATE\":\n        report_dating_text = f\"{original_fieldwork_completion_date}, except for {footnote_reference}, as to which the date is {subsequent_event_date}.\"\n        auditor_active_liability_scope = f\"Bounded at {original_fieldwork_completion_date} for entire financial statements; extended to {subsequent_event_date} SOLELY for {footnote_reference}.\"\n        re_audit_entire_entity_required = False\n    elif chosen_strategy == \"ADVANCE_OVERALL_DATE\":\n        report_dating_text = f\"{subsequent_event_date}\"\n        auditor_active_liability_scope = f\"Extended to {subsequent_event_date} for ALL financial statements, all cycles, and all disclosures.\"\n        re_audit_entire_entity_required = True\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(\"Invalid strategy. Choose 'DUAL_DATE' or 'ADVANCE_OVERALL_DATE'.\")\n        \n    return {\n        'original_date': original_fieldwork_completion_date,\n        'event_date': subsequent_event_date,\n        'issuance_date': financial_statement_issuance_date,\n        'event_description': event_description,\n        'strategy': chosen_strategy,\n        'formal_report_dating_signature': report_dating_text,\n        'auditor_legal_responsibility_scope': auditor_active_liability_scope,\n        'must_re_audit_all_cycles_to_new_date': re_audit_entire_entity_required\n    }\n\ndd_res = evaluate_dual_dating_decision()\nprint(\"=== Independent Auditor's Report Dating Protocol (PCAOB AS 3110) ===\")\nprint(f\"Original Fieldwork Completion:     {dd_res['original_date']}\")\nprint(f\"Post-Report Event Occurred:        {dd_res['event_date']} ({dd_res['event_description']})\")\nprint(f\"Scheduled Issuance / Filing:       {dd_res['issuance_date']}\")\nprint(f\"Selected Dating Strategy:          {dd_res['strategy']}\")\nprint(f\"Formal Audit Report Signature:     '{dd_res['formal_report_dating_signature']}'\")\nprint(f\"Auditor Legal Responsibility Scope:{dd_res['auditor_legal_responsibility_scope']}\")\nprint(f\"Re-Audit of Entire Entity Required:{dd_res['must_re_audit_all_cycles_to_new_date']}\")",
        "output": "=== Independent Auditor's Report Dating Protocol (PCAOB AS 3110) ===\nOriginal Fieldwork Completion:     2026-02-20\nPost-Report Event Occurred:        2026-02-28 (Fab facility explosion causing $80M damage)\nScheduled Issuance / Filing:       2026-03-05\nSelected Dating Strategy:          DUAL_DATE\nFormal Audit Report Signature:     '2026-02-20, except for Note 18 - Facility Casualty Loss, as to which the date is 2026-02-28.'\nAuditor Legal Responsibility Scope:Bounded at 2026-02-20 for entire financial statements; extended to 2026-02-28 SOLELY for Note 18 - Facility Casualty Loss.\nRe-Audit of Entire Entity Required:False",
        "tryIt": "Change chosen_strategy to 'ADVANCE_OVERALL_DATE' to see the signature become just '2026-02-28', the responsibility scope extend to ALL financial statements, all cycles, and all disclosures, and Re-Audit of Entire Entity Required turn True.",
