    "day": 54,
    "coursePrefix": "bcom_aud",
    "title": "Management Representations (AS 2805 / ISA 580) & Communicating with Audit Committees (AS 1301 / ISA 260)",
    "description": "Master the rigorous execution of written management representations and formal audit committee governance communications under PCAOB AS 2805, ISA 580, PCAOB AS 1301, and ISA 260. Learn to draft, tailor, and evaluate the Management Representation Letter, bind mandatory executive certifications (CEO and CFO), evaluate the consequences of management refusal to furnish written representations (mandatory scope limitation precluding an unqualified opinion), compile and communicate the Summary of Uncorrected Misstatements, present significant accounting policies and critical accounting estimates to the Board of Directors' Audit Committee, deliver the annual independence re-affirmation under PCAOB Rule 3526, and deploy automated governance communication engines.",
