        "example": "At Apex Global Technologies, the Master Opinion Decision Engine evaluated all four modification archetypes, deterministically generating exact AS 3105 statutory wording and demonstrating how pervasiveness dictates the boundary between a qualified, adverse, and disclaimer report.",
        "code": "def run_master_opinion_decision_simulator(\n    client: str = \"Apex Global Technologies Inc.\",\n    planning_mat: float = 27000000.0,\n    performance_mat: float = 18900000.0\n) -> list:\n    # Master Enterprise Opinion Decision Simulator\n    scenarios = [\n        {\n            'id': 'CASE-A',\n            'title': 'Unrecorded Environmental Cleanup Reserve',\n            'nature': 'GAAP_DEPARTURE',\n            'amount': 35000000.0,\n            'pervasive': False,\n            'scope_limit': False\n        },\n        {\n            'id': 'CASE-B',\n            'title': 'Customs Seizure of Singapore Hardware Warehouse',\n            'nature': 'SCOPE_LIMITATION',\n            'amount': 22000000.0,\n            'pervasive': False,\n            'scope_limit': True\n        },\n        {\n            'id': 'CASE-C',\n            'title': 'Systemic Fictitious Revenue & Unconsolidated Debt VIE',\n            'nature': 'GAAP_DEPARTURE',\n            'amount': 640000000.0,\n            'pervasive': True,\n            'scope_limit': False\n        },\n        {\n            'id': 'CASE-D',\n            'title': 'CEO/CFO Refusal to Sign AS 2805 Management Rep Letter',\n            'nature': 'SCOPE_LIMITATION',\n            'amount': 5400000000.0,\n            'pervasive': True,\n            'scope_limit': True\n        }\n    ]\n    \n    results = []\n    for s in scenarios:\n        is_mat = s['amount'] >= planning_mat or (s['scope_limit'] and s['amount'] >= performance_mat)\n        is_perv = s['pervasive']\n        \n        if is_mat and not is_perv:\n            if s['scope_limit']:\n                op = \"QUALIFIED_OPINION_SCOPE_LIMITATION\"\n                phrasing = \"except for the possible effects of the matter...\"\n            else:\n                op = \"QUALIFIED_OPINION_GAAP_DEPARTURE\"\n                phrasing = \"except for the effects of the matter...\"\n            cams = \"ALLOWED_EXCEPT_FOR_QUALIFIED_MATTER\"\n        elif is_mat and is_perv:\n            if s['scope_limit']:\n                op = \"DISCLAIMER_OF_OPINION\"\n                phrasing = \"we do not express an opinion on these consolidated financial statements\"\n            else:\n                op = \"ADVERSE_OPINION\"\n                phrasing = \"do not present fairly, in conformity with GAAP\"\n            cams = \"STRICTLY_PROHIBITED\"\n            \n        results.append({\n            'case': s['id'],\n            'title': s['title'],\n            'opinion': op,\n            'statutory_phrase': phrasing,\n            'cam_status': cams\n        })\n    return results\n\nsim_runs = run_master_opinion_decision_simulator()\nprint(\"=== Apex Global Technologies - Master Opinion Decision Simulator ===\")\nfor r in sim_runs:\n    print(f\"\\n[{r['case']}] {r['title']}\")\n    print(f\" Verdict:    {r['opinion']}\")\n    print(f\" Phrasing:   '{r['statutory_phrase']}'\")\n    print(f\" CAM Policy: {r['cam_status']}\")",
        "output": "=== Apex Global Technologies - Master Opinion Decision Simulator ===\n\n[CASE-A] Unrecorded Environmental Cleanup Reserve\n Verdict:    QUALIFIED_OPINION_GAAP_DEPARTURE\n Phrasing:   'except for the effects of the matter...'\n CAM Policy: ALLOWED_EXCEPT_FOR_QUALIFIED_MATTER\n\n[CASE-B] Customs Seizure of Singapore Hardware Warehouse\n Verdict:    QUALIFIED_OPINION_SCOPE_LIMITATION\n Phrasing:   'except for the possible effects of the matter...'\n CAM Policy: ALLOWED_EXCEPT_FOR_QUALIFIED_MATTER\n\n[CASE-C] Systemic Fictitious Revenue & Unconsolidated Debt VIE\n Verdict:    ADVERSE_OPINION\n Phrasing:   'do not present fairly, in conformity with GAAP'\n CAM Policy: STRICTLY_PROHIBITED\n\n[CASE-D] CEO/CFO Refusal to Sign AS 2805 Management Rep Letter\n Verdict:    DISCLAIMER_OF_OPINION\n Phrasing:   'we do not express an opinion on these consolidated financial statements'\n CAM Policy: STRICTLY_PROHIBITED",
